+/*
+ * (0330) The cluster as the bootloader left it (728 MHz, 675 mV on this phone: boot-0329), saved before the first raise,
+ * and the raised rate: with the screen off or the battery hot the cores go back to exactly the bootloader's numbers
+ * (hc_go_low), and up again to herocpu_mhz (hc_go_high). Only the power thread (hg_power_thread) moves them after boot.
